      <div class="vasp-term-body">
        <span class="tl"><span class="cmd">$ farscry diff before.png after.png</span></span>
        <span class="tl"><span class="sec">=== farscry diff ===</span></span>
        <span class="tl"><span class="k">from:</span> <span class="d">phash:8f4a2c3d</span></span>
